    <l n="9">præsenti producebatur positione)</l>
    <l n="10">futuro corripitur. Etymologia fu-</l>
    <l n="11">turi hujus, Grammaticis adhuc ve-</l>
    <l n="12">hementer incerta fuit: historia autem</l>
    <l n="13">inductis é lexico &amp; observatis gene-</l>
    <l n="14">ris hujus verbis simplicibus, theore-</l>
    <l n="15">ma pauló accuratius nobis attulit,</l>
